\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Stronger Late; HKMA  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Rumors Continue \b0\par\par\uc2 324 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 24 Juli 1997\par 10:02\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is stronger in late Asian trading Thursday, following unconfirmed rumors that the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has acted to stabilize the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  declined to comment on its activities Thursday, but the head of treasury at a domestic bank said rumors that it had sold an amount of under US$100.0 million at HK$7.7470 early Thursday were enough to cause banks to sell the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the spot market and drop the dollar as low as HK$7.7425. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar is quoted at HK$7.7443 at 0756 GMT (3:56 a.m. EDT), down from HK$7.7475 around the same time Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Rumors of \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  activity were touched off by a renewed burst of activity in the forwards market, where concerns about the Thai baht led banks to seek long-term funding to hedge their Hong Kong exposure, said a money markets chief at a U.S. bank. \par \par \uc2  The one-year U.S. dollar premium shot up to 1200.0 points from 500.0-900.0 points on Wednesday. It is at 1100.0 points at 0756 GMT. \par \par \uc2  Thursday's rise also takes the premium investors are willing to pay above the 900.0-point level recorded Monday, when pressure on the rupiah generated frenzied forward market activity. Those levels indicate participants expect the Hong Kong dollar to weaken significantly to HK$7.8643 over the next year. \par \par \uc2  Most buyers are interested in the two-month to six-month forwards Thursday, a period indicating they expect market volatility to continue for some time to come, said a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst with a European bank. \par \par \uc2  Like Monday, money market liquidity tightened, pushing all rates higher and prompting further talk that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is draining liquidity. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 24-07-97 \par \par \uc2  0802GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7o05fpb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
