\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Moderately Lower Late Amid Thin Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 16 Juli 1997\par 10:52\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is moderately lower late Wednesday. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers say trading remains 'very quiet' throughout the day. \par \par \uc2  Around 0830 GMT (04:30 a.m. EDT), the U.S. dollar is quoted at HK$7.7485, up from HK$7.7481 around the same time Tuesday, and also higher than the midday quote of HK$7.7480 Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. unit has traded in a range of HK$7.7475 and HK$7.7490 so far Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  'We saw a couple of commercial banks buying U.S. dollars earlier today (Wednesday),' said a dealer with a U.S. bank. But buying interests in the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  were capped as many traders believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  if the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  falls below HK$7.750. \par \par \uc2  'When the U.S. dollar reached the (HK$)7.7490 level, everybody started to sell' Wednesday, said a dealer with a large Hong Kong bank. \par \par \uc2  She said she expects to see the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  drop even further, eventually finding support around HK$7.7465 by the end of the week. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Meanwhile, the overnight Hong Kong dollar interbank offered rate\par remains unchanged, while the one-week interbank offered rate slipped\par slightly:\par Hong Kong Dollar Interbank Offered Rates\par                            Wednesday       Tuesday\par Overnight                  5.5%            5.5%\par 1-Week                     5.8125%         6.0%\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For a full list of the latest quotes on Hibor, please refer to Dow\par Jones Markets page [2705]. For daily fixings in the Hibor market, as\par quoted by the Hong Kong Association of Banks, please refer to Dow Jones\par Markets pages [9898-9899].\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par For latest bill, note and bond quotes, please refer to Dow Jones\par Markets page [9888].\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 16-07-97\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par 0852GMT\par \f28 \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt7g055wc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
