\par\par \b \uc2  HK Handover/HK Dlr Peg Secure -3: 'A Winning Formula' \b0\par\par\uc2 421 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Juni 1997\par 04:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'In our view, such speculation is groundless,' according to a Merrill Lynch & Co. report. 'There is no desire on China's part to change a winning formula.' The firm's Richard Margolis added that he thinks hedge funds and other would-be speculators have subscribed to that opinion too, even if economists such as Rabushka and Nobel laureate Milton Friedman don't. \par \par \uc2  'I suspect there is more good than bad' in the peg and that doing away with it is 'simply too big of a risk to take,' said T.C. Chan, head of commercial and investment banking in Hong Kong at Citibank N.A. 'I think by and large people believe in the peg, at least in the short term, at least the next two years.' \par \par \uc2  The HKMA stresses that the Basic Law promises the Hong Kong dollar will be around for 50 years. Asked about the chance for convergence of the Chinese and Hong Kong monetary systems, the HKMA Chief Yam usually responds: 'not in my lifetime.' \par \par \uc2  But the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  does permit some unspecified leeway in the Hong Kong dollar's market value, generally believed to be 1.0% on either side of peg, or about HK$7.7250 to HK$7.8780. \par \par \uc2  Merrill Lynch data show the market expects less than that amount of movement over two years, although the most pessimistic forecast is for a 10% drop to HK$8.6000. 'But that's right out on a limb,' said analyst Margolis. 'The consensus is for a negligible movement.' \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was around HK$7.7430. \par \par \uc2  Rarely dipping into the hefty \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  balance under its control, the HKMA uses interest rates to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  rate smooth day-to-day, draining or adding funds from the banking system as needed. In any case, the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is affected a lot more often by new share offerings than any speculation about the peg. On the most active days, the HKMA does 'check' with dealers to make them make them aware of its vigilance, though evidence of actual \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is hard to find. \par \par \uc2  Public confidence in the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is the most crucial element for it to maintain its value, as was shown during the emergency of 1983 when the U.S. dollar peg had to be established in order to restore local trust. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 05-06-97 \par \par \uc2  0229GMT \par \par \uc2  1135 4202 55126 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt65044fn\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
