Hong Kong dollars when the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  climbed slightly early Wednesday, the dealer said.< \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 09-04-97 \par \par \uc2  0249GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt4902feb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
