ht22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market was volatile but moved in line with other regional \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and equity markets, falling early, then recovering later in the day. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1039GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4203 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2k0178g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
