\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Or Not, Few Doubt China Commitment To HK Dlr \b0\par\par\uc2  By Adam S. Najberg \par \uc2 314 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Februar 1997\par 11:00\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--Deng Xiaoping won't realize his dream of visiting Hong Kong, but some participants said his spirit was felt in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Thursday as Chinese and Hong Kong authorities worked hand-in-hand to keep the territory stable. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading was volatile, but not nearly as earthshaking as had been expected in the first Asian trading session following the death of China's paramount leader and architect of the 'one country, two systems' plan for Hong Kong. \par \par \uc2  And after an initial upward hiccup by the U.S. dollar to HK$7.7500 in New York, it was the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  that lost ground when Asian trading got underway. It dropped steadily to HK$7.7389 late Thursday. It is at HK$7.7415 at 0946 GMT. \par \par \uc2  The reason for the Hong Kong dollar's strong performance is unclear, with some participants and market watchers claiming the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 , and others saying either the Bank of China-\b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  branch, Hongkong & Shanghai Banking Corp., or both, supported the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Still others insisted it was simply business as usual. \par \par \uc2  Whatever the case, all agree that relative calm prevailed in Hong Kong's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Thursday after an early burst of confusion, indicating investors felt there was little to fear from Deng's death. \par \par \uc2  Money market activity, valued at HK$29.22 billion, was actually below the HK$32.24 billion recorded Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  'This had been discounted in the market,' said Horace Fan, treasury chief at Hong Kong's Wing On Bank Ltd., noting that rumors have persisted for years and were particularly strong over the past week. 'People realize that Deng Xiaoping's passing away is not a big thing.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-02-97 \par \par \uc2  1000GMT \par \par \uc2  1136 4203 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dt2k0175y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
