\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Unchanged In Quiet Post-Holiday Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 22 Oktober 1996\par 06:59\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-Dow Jones)--The Hong Kong dollar is unchanged Tuesday in quiet trading after a holiday weekend, with no direction from also steady local interest rates, bond yields and stock market. \par \par \uc2  Around 0445 GMT, the U.S. dollar is quoted at $7.7322 (Hong Kong), unchanged from around the same time Friday. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong market was closed Monday for a holiday. \par \par \uc2  Traders say there is a lot of cash liquidity in the Hong Kong dollar money markets, which has contributed to the stability of the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  in recent weeks. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar has hovered closely around the HK$7.7320 level for several weeks and is likely to continue to do so this week, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  'It's rather quiet (Tuesday). We've heard of some money flowing in, on stock market speculation, and some interest in selling U.S. dollars and buying Hong Kong dollars,' said the head of money markets at a large local bank. 'So last week, the HKMA (\b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  and was buying U.S. dollars, to keep the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar steady.' \par \par \uc2  But so far this week, the market has been mostly unchanged, he added, with no activity reported from the HKMA. \par \par \uc2  At the midday close, the Hang Seng index was up a meager 0.09 points to 12510.14 points. \par \par \uc2  There was widespread expectation that last month's Federal Open Market Committee meeting would produce an interest rate rise, but it didn't, said the dealer. As a result, he added, most players are long in cash and there is a lot of liquidity in the system. This is keeping interbank rates from getting too high, he said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 22-10-96 \par \par \uc2  0459GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 4178 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011014dsam008gd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
