\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Moving Stronger -2:  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Concerns \b0\par\par\uc2 301 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 Juni 1996\par 11:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'London was 200-odd points down, but when it came to Hong Kong, the stock market didn't collapse...That means the stock market is really resilient,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The senior manager said he saw only light Hong Kong dollar commercial demand in early trading, but by early afternoon, began to see large local banks and some overseas investors buying larger amounts of the territory's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  He said the dollar's afternoon reversal in the territory's markets was also due to concern over potential \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA). \par \par \uc2  'When this morning, we saw the 'TT' above HK$7.7400, then people start to think at this level, the HKMA would like to see what's going on and may step in sooner or later and \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' he said. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , however, stayed largely out of money markets, making a slight injection of HK$3.0 million by 0800 GMT, and wasn't seen at all in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  The senior manager said if speculators are going to make a move into the U.S. dollar, they're likely to do it in London Monday, but that he doesn't see any signs of significant activity from the London market. \par \par \uc2  Over the rest of the week, the senior manager said the Hong Kong dollar will be under pressure to move weaker, due to the uncertain resolution of the U.S.-China intellectual property rights protection talks and a potential trade war if the two sides don't settle differences. \par \par \uc2  He said it would be difficult to predict a range, but that another run by the U.S. dollar over HK$7.7400 wouldn't be unusual. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 10-06-96 \par \par \uc2  0933GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds6a04s9x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
