\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Flat On Concerns About HKMA Market  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 288 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 Mai 1996\par 08:03\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1996, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2  (AP-Dow Jones)--The \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar is unchanged Friday as concerns about U.S. trade sanctions on China have given way to concerns that the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  would protect the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  if there is any further weakening. \par \par \uc2  At about 0545 GMT, the U.S. dollar is quoted at $7.7370 (Hong Kong), unchanged from around the same time Thursday. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said an inactive stock market Friday is also contibuting to the immobility of the Hong Kong dollar. \par \par \uc2  'My feeling is that perhaps the HKMA is in the market supporting the Hong Kong dollar, so it would not get any weaker,' said a \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a large Japanese bank. But he said he hadn't directly witnessed the HKMA buying Hong Kong dollars. \par \par \uc2  Thursday, the U.S. dollar hit a new year's high of HK$7.372 on fears that a trade war between the U.S. and China would damage Hong Kong's export-driven economy. \par \par \uc2  But the trader said he didn't consider Thursday's drop a dramatic selloff. \par \par \uc2  'I wouldn't call it a selloff - it was just a touch higher. The movement (Thursday) was less than 0.1%,' he said. \par \par \uc2  A quiet stock market is damping activity in Hong Kong dollar trading. At the midday close, the Hang Seng index was down a meager 11.25 points to 10822.16 points. \par \par \uc2  Short-term local interest rates are also unchanged, although medium-term rates and bond yields are higher. However, this is mostly in the wake of a selloff of the U.S. Treasurys market Thursday, traders said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 17-05-96 \par \par \uc2  0603GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011013ds5h043sh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
