\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Stays Flat In Extremely Low Turnover Trading \b0\par\par\uc2 302 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Oktober 1995\par 05:31\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-DJ)--The Hong Kong dollar is treading water Tuesday at levels virtually unchanged from the previous session in some of the year's lowest-turnover trading, participants say. \par \par \uc2  After opening at $7.7326 (Hong Kong) on Tuesday, the U.S. dollar, referred to locally as the 'TT,' crept up to HK$7.7327, where it has held until 0414 GMT. At that level, it is nearly flat from HK$7.7329 around the same time Monday. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer with a local bank says activity in the U.S. dollar-Hong Kong dollar \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has all but dried up on Tuesday, leaving the Hong Kong dollar mired in its tightest range in recent months. \par \par \uc2  'I think the 'TT' market has been stuck in a really tight range for nearly two months, with the daily movement just around five points only,' he says. 'Today, no one wants to take any positions.' \par \par \uc2  The dealer says he sees absolutely no month-end demand for either the U.S. dollar or Hong Kong dollar, nor does he see either \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moving substantially in any direction through the year-end. \par \par \uc2  'I think most of the banks' positions are long positions,' he says, noting it is in the interest of most banks to have the Hong Kong dollar hold steady through the end of December. \par \par \uc2  He says some banks have a real U.S. or Hong Kong dollar need at the year-end, which means they would be wary of liquidating positions. \par \par \uc2  He also says concerns that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  and money markets is acting as a deterrent for speculators, who could potentially move the thin turnover markets. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-10-95 \par \par \uc2  0431GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drav08im8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
