\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Stronger/ \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  -3: Activity In Spot Market \b0\par\par\uc2 224 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 August 1995\par 06:01\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  The head of money markets at a U.S.-based bank says the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is probably exercising a measure of control over the Hong Kong dollar/U.S. dollar exchange rate through its overnight discount window, the Liquidity Adjustment Facility (LAF). \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  has drained a net HK$311.0 million from the LAF as of 0300 GMT. Between 0200 GMT and 0400 GMT, it reports its money market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  on an hourly basis. \par \par \uc2  Osbert Lam Kar-yin, a spokesman for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , says the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is maintaining 'normal open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  'We will fine-tune the level of the Hong Kong dollar and the interbank market. We see it as something normal, not something strange,' Lam said. 'What we have done in the past two days is normal open market \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  But the money market head says he also believes the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  began \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the spot \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Friday, buying \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollars when its money-market tightening was unable to prevent the U.S. dollar from hitting HK$7.7430. \par \par \uc2  'That's their level of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' he says. \par \par \uc2  He says rumors are also that 