\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Nearly Flat -2: HIBOR Remain Steady, Yields Slip \b0\par\par\uc2 275 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 7 August 1995\par 07:08\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Although the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is normally lethargic during July and August, the dealer says concerns that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2  dollar if the U.S. dollar pushes its way over HK$7.7400 are probably further dampening investor sentiment. \par \par \uc2  In money market activity so far Monday, the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the quasi \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has drained a net HK$38.0 million, including the reversal of its discount window facility, the Liquidity Adjustment Facility (LAF). \par \par \uc2  Among rates, the more-volatile overnight Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate (HIBOR) is flat at 5.50% from Friday. \par \par \uc2  And the one-week HIBOR is steady at 5.5625% and compares with the one-week yield Monday for the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's Exchange Fund bills of 5.225%. \par \par \uc2  Three-month HIBOR stands at 5.8125%, flat as it has been over the past six weeks, and compares with the three-month Exchange Fund bills yield of 5.405%. \par \par \uc2  The six-month HIBOR money market rate is steady at 5.9375% and compares with the Exchange Fund bill yield for that maturity quoted at 5.515% on Monday. \par \par \uc2  Bond yields are down on Monday. The yield on two-year Hong Kong Government bonds is quoted at 6.00%, compared with 6.06% at around the same time the previous session. \par \par \uc2  The three-year issue is at 6.49%, compared with 6.52%. \par \par \uc2  The five-year issue's yield is 7.62% from 7.66% around the same time Friday. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 07-08-95 \par \par \uc2  0508GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr8705yf6\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
