\par\par \b \uc2  HK Dollar Flat; No Cues From London And New York Markets \b0\par\par\uc2 297 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 Mai 1995\par 06:13\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-DJ)--With no guiding signs from London or New York, the Hong Kong dollar remains nearly flat, but has widened its trading range against its U.S. counterpart around midday in the territory Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Markets in London were closed for a banking holiday Monday, while U.S. markets remained shut for the long Memorial Day holiday weekend. \par \par \uc2  The U.S. dollar traded in a narrow 12-point range on Monday. On Tuesday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market is still quiet, though the trading range has broadened to between $7.7345 (Hong Kong) and HK$7.7361. \par \par \uc2  At 0355 GMT, the dollar, also called the 'TT', is quoted at HK$7.7355, up slightly from HK$7.7353 recorded around the same time Monday. \par \par \uc2  A \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealer at a North American-based bank says the U.S. dollar should remain range-bound between HK$7.7340 and HK$7.7370 for the remainder of the day. \par \par \uc2  He says he expects quiet local market conditions to continue and doesn't see the U.S. dollar gaining much upward momentum against the Hong Kong dollar when trading resumes in London and New York markets later Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  U.S. dollar buying sentiment is likely to remain blunted, with investors unlikely or unwilling to push the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  past the HK$7.7400 level, the dealer says. \par \par \uc2  'As the 'TT' approaches HK$7.7400, they're very cautious to buy. I think they're afraid of (\b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ,' the dealer says. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has used an array of methods in recent months to steady the U.S. dollar-Hong Kong dollar exchange rate. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 30-05-95 \par \par \uc2  0413GMT \par \par \uc2  1053 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr5u03z72\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
