\par\par \b \uc2  HK  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Declares  \highlight22\uc2 Currency \highlight\uc2  Stability: Amplifier \b0\par\par\uc2 291 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Januar 1995\par 13:49\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  by JAMES T. AREDDY \par \par \uc2  HONG KONG (AP-DJ)--Central bankers at the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Friday claimed success in stabilizing the Hong Kong dollar after they faced down speculators for the second straight day. \par \par \uc2  With the Hong Kong dollar securely pegged to the U.S. dollar, no one seriously expects a breakdown in the system. \par \par \uc2  Nevertheless, at least in the short-term, \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  turbulence will continue to haunt Hong Kong and other Asian countries, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  will be forced back into the market, according to traders and economists. \par \par \uc2  The results of Friday's heavy-handed \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's money market - double-digit money market interest rates and a resurgent \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  - burned speculators who sold the Hong Kong dollar short, participants agree. \par \par \uc2  Other Hong Kong dollar markets were also upset by the uncertainty surrounding the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Friday. Some well-known bond brokers, for example, refused to quote prices on local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt because 'people don't know how to quote' in such a roller-coaster market, said Virginia Poon, Chase Manhattan Asia Ltd.'s head of Asian syndications. \par \par \uc2  The fact that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  could reverse its tight stance in Hong Kong's money markets by late Friday underscored the success of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions, said Julia Leung, a spokeswoman for the quasi-\b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  Standard Chartered Bank General Manager Ian Wilson said he hopes the market understands that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  is 'prepared to safeguard the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  However, he added, 'who can say what is in a speculator's mind? I imagine if they see an opportunity they will try to gain from it.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-01-95 \par \par \uc2  1249GMT \par \par \uc2  1139 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr1d003mq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
