\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong intervenes \highlight\uc2  to stabilise  \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2 . \b0\par\par\uc2  By Kwan Chooi Tow \par \uc2 394 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 12 Januar 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 HONG KONG\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Jan 12 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Hong Kong\b0 \highlight\uc2 's monetary authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets during trading on Thursday which saw the Hong Kong dollar hit an 18-month intra-day low. \par \par \uc2  The Hong Kong dollar, which is officially pegged to the U.S. dollar at 7.8 normally trades in an extremely tight range stronger than the peg rate. \par \par \uc2  It has traded at the 7.75-76 level during most of this week, but sank to 7.7721 on Thursday afternoon. \par \par \uc2  It closed at 7.7710/40, but recovered slightly in European trading. \par \par \uc2  "This is the first time in two years that the local dollar fluctuated wildly," a Hong Kong dealer said. \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong's de facto \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the Hong Kong \b \highlight22\uc2 Monetary Authority\b0 \highlight\uc2  (HKMA), stepped in Thursday morning by withdrawing a total of HK$5.42 billion ($690 million) from the banking system. \par \par \uc2  It added funds again in the afternoon, leaving net withdrawls of HK$659 million ($84 million). \par \par \uc2  "With the easing of the Hong Kong dollar rate, we find it necessary to move the Hong Kong Interbank Offered Rate closer to the LAF (Liquidity Adjustment Facility) offer rate," said a HKMA spokeswoman. \par \par \uc2  "This means the authority is standing out to defend the Hong Kong dollar," said a dealer with a European bank. \par \par \uc2  Analysts said the Hong Kong government's policy was to avoid speculative movements in the dollar's rate, and this is why it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "These are strong gestures from the HKMA but it doesn't cap the market immediately...it takes the market some time, maybe a week or two (before the HKMA's actions take effect)," said Davy Kwan, first vice president at the International Bank of Asia. \par \par \uc2  Brokers and analysts said the local \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has weakened on a combination of speculation, pre-Lunar New Year seasonal demand and an outflow of foreign capital following poor stock market performance. \par \par \uc2  Hong Kong's blue-chip Hang Seng has fallen 772.99 points or 9.4 percent since the beginning of the year. It has also dropped more than a third from its peak during 1994. \par \par \uc2  "A lot of hot money has been flowing out of Hong Kong so some banks are quite short of U.S. dollars," said a dealer with an American bank. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr1c088d3\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (hong kong near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clv